      "content": "SP 81 SE             BUCKLAND                 BUCKLAND VILLAGE                                               west side 5/53                                          West Cottage II Cottage. C17 altered,. Timber framed with colourwashed brick infill, some tile hanging. Thatched roof, half hipped with central brick chimney. 2 eaves dormers. 1½ storeys, open porches each side with tiled lean-to roof, two 3-light casements between and panel with crest of Edward Bonus under eaves. Modern square bay to RH gable with tiled roof, 2-light casement above. Modern 1 storey lean-to extension to rear. Listing NGR: SP8860612879"
    }
